 "html": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\" trbidi=\"on\">\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhlUmCN8KxsG34BPE-zJ8zMhTlTHRV69fMdFwboAtUXNJWACA0nOwAQGaGRG5G2l1N0IeUBb5meTvHLskWwfGiDUXEiQDTjnBpArdaCOEiiSg1qYx-3fUjSyD1jr1JJquxVnir9n35-96g/s1200/15ConferenceFacebook_04022016.jpg\" /></div>\n<br />\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"http://sakyadhita.org/conferences/15th-si-con.html\" target=\"_blank\">Visit the Sakyadhita International website to register </a></h3>\n<br />\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhR5PwgsW0z8DVbdJrBmhTSidqBADlqMoiyNIwlQ6CeSMlyG7DGtSkvG-BYceZXJ828cTv2GGrxkBkfam8N1Jg8Zia0gi9qTjGO1Rb8LjEbDiC-ax0aHgN6gGEeShEd8QnfZlWIIkgY9n4/s1200/SI-Banner_12212016-590x101px.jpg\" /></div>\n<br />\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">\nLearn More About the 15th Sakyadhita International Conference on Buddhist Women</h3>\n<br />\nThe theme for the 2017 conference to be held at The University of Hong Kong is “Contemporary Buddhist Women: Contemplation,\n Cultural Exchange &amp; Social Action.” This theme highlights the diversity of \ncontemporary Buddhist women throughout the world.\n</div>\n"
